summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 dev2 and later\r\n- Not reproducible in 4.4 dev1 or earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev3 - Windows 10.0.22631 - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.5599) - AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a resource has an exported array, the exported array is properly set in the editor. However, when the project is exported, the array is not set properly, instead being empty.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the project in a 4.4dev3 or 4.4dev2 editor and see that the color of the icon is set correctly due to a resource that contains an exported array, then export the project in that same editor, seeing that the icon is a different color due to the array being empty.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-zone.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17510870/test-zone.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_eve